// The Windows driver set as RCDATA resources, one per file of driver_info.h's list, each named by its
// symbol stem in upper case, which the loader looks up in its own module. Filled in by
// third_party/redshift_odbc/tools/lib/driver_info.py, which writes each path in full with forward
// slashes: the resource compiler reads a backslash in a string as an escape. One language, neutral,
// so each file is one resource.
LANGUAGE 0, 0
@REDSHIFT_DRIVER_RESOURCES@
